  "scope": "Paired run-level serial completed-render time ratios, candidate/declared-baseline (native MSAA4 or same-resolution bilinear); each run uses 1000/completed_render_fps. Lower is faster. Includes CPU preparation, scheduling, callback delivery and polling; not normal pipelined FPS, GPU busy cost, GPU hardware latency or presentation.",
